Unit Restriction: Only [[Secret Crush Cat (Special Cat)|Secret Crush Cat]], [[Tomboy Lion Cat (Special Cat)|Tomboy Lion Cat]], [[Chalkboard Eraser Cat (Special Cat)|Chalkboard Eraser Cat]], [[Class Rep Cat (Special Cat)|Class Rep Cat]] and [[Principal Cat (Special Cat)|Principal Cat]]

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Confessional Tree (Enemy Base)|Confessional Tree]].
*1 [[Red Wind]] (500%) spawns.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (500%) spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (500%) spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (500%) spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (500%) spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Red Wind]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Red Wind]]s (500%) spawn, delay 11.67~13.33 seconds<sup>350f~400f</sup>.
**4 [[Red Wind]]s (500%) spawn, delay 8.33~10 seconds<sup>250f~300f</sup>.
**6 [[Red Wind]]s (500%) spawn, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.

